{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "2eff92c48df76e4dfd947eb607eccc8ce4b6b74ad516b5efa44401a08bb8c001", "ja": "次なる物語へ", "zh": "迈向下一个故事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "691a49931a80b747468e0fa12ba917641bb21784c48e6853ef0a29b1882d080e", "ja": "第七幕も成功に終わり、打ち上げは麗花の\n希望で麗花の家に。みんなで第八幕の台本を\nぎゅーっとくっついてお話しながら読もうと\nいう麗花の提案だったが、まずは散らかった\n部屋の掃除から始める事になるのだった…。", "zh": "第七幕也圆满结束，大家按照丽花的心愿，来到了丽花家举办庆功宴。丽花提议大家紧紧挨在一起，一边聊天一边读第八幕的剧本，但最后却变成了先从打扫凌乱的房间开始……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "50737622716342331d55347301b6857481c93152251da50964439691eef20e75", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』第七幕も千秋楽。\n衝撃的な展開は、大いに話題になった！）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》第七幕也顺利迎来了最终场演出。\n冲击性的展开引发了热烈讨论！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e2d15b21951496224c2cd54a80eb657bc8e9d50b5a630c83c83cf86351087cda", "ja": "（見事に演じきったみんなを労う打ち上げは、麗花の\n家で行う事になったが……嫌な予感が、少し……）", "zh": "（为了犒劳精彩演完的大家，决定在丽花家举办庆功宴，可是……隐隐有种不好的预感……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b43b4940a3e6d7783dfcfb58328c119ff5d7f1d57114c819bbe88c22d66293e1", "ja": "（やっぱり……歌織さんたちとルームシェアした時に\n掃除したのに、元に戻ってる……）", "zh": "（果然……之前和歌织小姐她们合租时明明打扫过，结果又恢复原样了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "c90edc1971341b1ef76a72acc74f0cd152986ceb863ae89c9400df0dfa07b4ac", "ja": "私、よくお母さんに「片付けはマメにしなさい」\nって、注意されるんですけど……。", "zh": "我经常被妈妈说\"要勤快地收拾东西\"……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "72e862c55a65d13a07a188b6013d812773026ac92da9904e6373df31be72e79e", "ja": "大人の人のお部屋がこれくらい散らかってるなら、\n私って全然大丈夫なんだ！", "zh": "大人的房间要是也乱成这样的话，\n那我其实完全没问题嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "53abb925cde2c9712cd89d1f8a225ddecea522c7cc0e907a95a23fab6062aec5", "ja": "うん、全然大丈夫！　私の場合は、\n意外なところで、忘れ物と再会できたりするよ♪", "zh": "嗯，完全没问题！像我呀，\n还经常能在意想不到的地方和落下的东西重逢呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "467df631f41ee004646599cfbf0c8c08c4bc1ddbcd3cba0f82e4bffd51dfaaff", "ja": "……。なによりもまず掃除、ですね。\nほら、エミリーも。", "zh": "……总之，首先得打扫才行。\n看吧，艾米莉也一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "9679886320102a22b251b1bb5000d0a23aaee5b2231ccd2421415c11ae5497f5", "ja": "はっ！　そ、そうですね……。\n麗花さんに恩返しをする、絶好の機会です！", "zh": "啊！对、对啊……这是回报丽花小姐恩情的绝佳机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "2fca80cf410acaff2d89957582348f3bd675deb9b4a237b3ca2eff972bba5f42", "ja": "恩返し？", "zh": "报恩？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "de195f0bb3ff296ee55d79ea7e92336b94d7145ab13e62e48b98d03a3c8237aa", "ja": "はい。麗花さんが山登りに誘ってくれたことで、\n演技のきっかけが掴めましたし。", "zh": "是的。多亏丽花小姐邀请我去爬山，我找到了演戏的契机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "681f900d18806583adcb948f8561af9d47786ff581e6adb24838668cf4b0c3a9", "ja": "それに、こうして打ち上げの場所も提供いただいて……\n本当に、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "而且，还为我们提供了庆功宴的场地……\n真的非常感谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "33f6d231ad7bd889e30e03bf77b87b2816b38da38daa3bb972f27a1084847f71", "ja": "ううん！\nみんなで山登りできて、とっても楽しかったし。", "zh": "不用客气！\n而且大家一起去登山，我也玩得特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "1545948bfeeaebc82b80d10641a7b56ee03c7df51bcd67c677dc3615ce2164fd", "ja": "今日も、私が{$P$}さんに、\n私のうちでやりたいです♪ってお願いしただけだから。", "zh": "因为今天也是我拜托{$P$}先生，说想在我家进行♪而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "53ab7cbb386f9bfa6df0b325684332d19148be3b098a9baca143bc4a67f6afba", "ja": "そうだったんですか？\nけど、どうして……。", "zh": "原来是这样吗？\n可是，为什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "5698b41bea68c1aa8f3e84eb993a2026166aa906ab059ae6827f980b62e21983", "ja": "千秋楽を迎えたら、みんなで\n第八幕の台本を読む約束だったでしょ？", "zh": "等到最后一场演出结束后，不是约好了要和大家一起读第八幕的剧本吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "4dc7101f45d001374e92474ccbac741c414e59e22dbfaca3bfc8ca69825c971d", "ja": "せっかくだから、みんなとぎゅーってくっつきながら\nたくさんお話して、それで読みたいなって思ったんだ。", "zh": "难得有这个机会，我想和大家紧紧贴在一起聊好多好多，然后再一起读。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5db39874f211d6517f5a863a0bd5025d7bcf8dba82e0a2a7573b65501451c721", "ja": "……ああ、そうだな。\nもちろん、第八幕の台本も持ってきてるよ。", "zh": "……啊，说得也是。\n当然也把第八幕的剧本带来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "721201d7474ab3d4a0ac88d7992ad16cf40583d37cff7f3bc9f7f45edab1a2d5", "ja": "わあ、念願の続きですね！\nそれじゃあ急いで掃除しなくちゃ！　ええと……。", "zh": "哇，是期待已久的后续呢！\n那就得赶紧打扫了！呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "39a7d757e85d4638251b55c90ddc6fa5d4bebe0674f49871604aa237fb946d97", "ja": "そうね。……私は、落ちている洗濯物を集めるから。\n未来とエミリーは部屋のゴミをまとめて。", "zh": "是啊。……我来把散落的衣物收起来。未来和艾米莉，把房间里的垃圾收拾到一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "89a4e02e7227f4101934dba6768dd70d2049f9756698dfbc744bbc0d7cb5d718", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\n台所まわりをお願いします。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n厨房那边就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "03fd71b0234c1000d88d178c24651980ef986da8ae2c1ff4026cfb533f310987", "ja": "ああ、わかった！", "zh": "好，明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "ed1ee1befaf78412dfaec61fa2650df11e681d4531627620cb3f5ad129d4f622", "ja": "私にできることは……やっぱり応援かな！\n頑張れ、みんな～！　どんどんぱふぱふー♪", "zh": "我能做的事……果然还是给大家加油吧！\n加油，大家～！咚咚锵锵——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "749cea480c7f6648f3ed5e11f31b688171ffe11d7b35216b93b4d4c7ef00d916", "ja": "れ、麗花さん。私たちだけでは、要不要が\nわかりませんので……一緒に、お願いします！", "zh": "丽、丽花小姐。光靠我们自己，分不清哪些该留、哪些该丢……请和我们一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "464f1919256bb66f4077614d1d370fd62509eb00aefd1f9f256e1e70f4faf8e3", "ja": "はーい♪\n普通にお掃除、やってみるね！", "zh": "好——♪\n我来试试看普通地打扫吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "95770eb722cd7ba5a237c307c3de7c9a42162897915a35d94a02842abfc6c094", "ja": "（終わることがないように思えていた\n『STARDOM ROAD』公演も終盤戦……）", "zh": "（仿佛永远不会结束的《STARDOM ROAD》公演，也进入了最后阶段……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "edf7eceda4689a7d9b453c7b3ae542cdb5410cd3bfe1d0f419c89d3556478f2f", "ja": "（どんなドラマが待ち受けていても、アイドル達……\nそして真珠星達と、最後まで駆け抜けるぞ！）", "zh": "（无论等待着我们的是什么样的剧情，偶像们……\n还有珍珠星们，都要一起冲到最后！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
